{"comments":"PropertyLink — Property Connection/Expression Handle\n\nA draggable handle for creating links between layer properties.\nThe core of motion graphics expression systems (like After Effects).\n\n## Usage\n\n```purescript\nimport Hydrogen.Element.Compound.Motion.Property.PropertyLink as Link\n\n-- Unlinked property\nLink.propertyLink\n  [ Link.layerId \"layer-1\"\n  , Link.propertyPath \"transform.position.x\"\n  , Link.onLink HandleLink\n  ]\n\n-- Linked property\nLink.propertyLink\n  [ Link.layerId \"layer-1\"\n  , Link.propertyPath \"transform.position.x\"\n  , Link.linkedTo (Just { layerId: \"layer-2\", property: \"transform.position.x\" })\n  , Link.onLink HandleLink\n  , Link.onUnlink HandleUnlink\n  ]\n```\n","declarations":[{"children":[],"comments":"PropertyLink component\n\nA draggable handle for creating property links.\nPure Element — renders to DOM, Halogen, Static HTML, or any target.\n\nThe visual appearance changes based on link state:\n- Unlinked: Gray dot with crosshairs\n- Linked: Green dot with connection lines\n","info":{"declType":"value","type":{"annotation":[],"contents":{"identifier":"msg","kind":null,"skolem":null,"type":{"annotation":[],"contents":[{"annotation":[],"contents":[{"annotation":[],"contents":[["Prim"],"Function"],"tag":"TypeConstructor"},{"annotation":[],"contents":[{"annotation":[],"contents":[["Prim"],"Array"],"tag":"TypeConstructor"},{"annotation":[],"contents":{"annotation":[],"contents":[{"annotation":[],"contents":[["Hydrogen","Element","Compound","Motion","Property","PropertyLink"],"PropertyLinkProp"],"tag":"TypeConstructor"},{"annotation":[],"contents":"msg","tag":"TypeVar"}],"tag":"TypeApp"},"tag":"ParensInType"}],"tag":"TypeApp"}],"tag":"TypeApp"},{"annotation":[],"contents":[{"annotation":[],"contents":[["Hydrogen","Render","Element"],"Element"],"tag":"TypeConstructor"},{"annotation":[],"contents":"msg","tag":"TypeVar"}],"tag":"TypeApp"}],"tag":"TypeApp"},"visibility":"TypeVarInvisible"},"tag":"ForAll"}},"